---
Add, list, and change reminders

Usage: nib task [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  add       Add a reminder
  list      List reminders (the default) [alias: ls]
  lists     List and manage reminder lists
  edit      Edit reminders as a Markdown file in $VISUAL or $EDITOR
  done      Mark reminders completed
  reopen    Mark completed reminders open again
  priority  Set or clear the priority of reminders
  move      Move reminders to another list
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json  Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help  Print help
